menuconfig PET
    bool "Tamagotchi virtual pet"
    depends on APPLICATION_UI
    default y
    help
      Run a Tamagotchi P1 emulator (TamaLIB, GPLv2) as a full-screen pet on
      the device. The pet is voice-controlled via the pet_care MCP tool,
      survives power cycles through lisa_kv and beeps through the miniapp
      player when MINIAPP_BUZZER is enabled.

if PET

config PET_BUZZER
    bool "Pet piezo beep synthesis"
    depends on MINIAPP_BUZZER
    default y
    help
      Synthesize the original piezo beeps as 16 kHz square waves. Without
      this (or without MINIAPP_BUZZER) the pet stays silent.

endif
